{"id": "presidio-terrace-returned-tax-sale-notice", "title": "San Francisco sold a private street after the auction notice came back", "seconds": 54.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6eb759b072fae47a", "words": 141, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "San Francisco sold a privately owned street for $90,100.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.25, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "received", "the", "notice?"], "sub": "Presidio Terrace"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 1.0, 1.28, 1.35, 1.93, 2.22, 2.65, 2.86, 3.24, 3.81, 4.03, 4.37]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Before the auction, the certified notice came back undelivered.", "t0": 5.37, "t1": 8.65, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "find", "kicker": "The returned notice", "text": "March 9, 2015", "mark": "March 9"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.52, 0.94, 1.03, 1.6, 1.97, 2.24, 2.56]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Eight bidders placed 140 bids for the common-area parcel.", "t0": 8.77, "t1": 12.86, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "140", "label": "Auction bids"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.8, 1.18, 1.4, 1.77, 2.13, 2.51, 2.68, 2.79, 3.49]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The listed redemption amount was $994.77.", "t0": 12.98, "t1": 18.2, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$994.77", "label": "Redemption amount"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.55, 1.08, 1.49, 1.73, 2.04, 2.41, 3.01, 3.53, 3.79, 4.66]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Tax Collector said the association had left an old address on file.", "t0": 18.42, "t1": 22.43, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ttx", "kicker": "The Tax Collector’s position", "text": "Last known mailing address", "mark": "mailing address"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.96, 1.15, 1.24, 2.0, 2.15, 2.42, 2.56, 2.81, 3.26, 3.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Supervisors voted 7 to 4 to reverse the sale. They wanted follow-up notice.", "t0": 22.55, "t1": 28.1, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "find", "kicker": "The Board findings", "text": "Additional steps", "mark": "steps"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.89, 1.24, 1.65, 1.83, 2.24, 2.42, 2.86, 2.98, 3.85, 4.09, 4.44, 5.0]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2018 the Board required physical posting when a vacant parcel’s mail came back.", "t0": 28.22, "t1": 33.18, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reform", "kicker": "The next auction", "text": "Physical notice", "mark": "notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.52, 0.98, 1.07, 1.38, 1.83, 2.33, 2.87, 3.04, 3.11, 3.5, 4.0, 4.29, 4.57]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Hiuyan Lam challenged the reversal in court.", "t0": 33.4, "t1": 35.88, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "writ", "kicker": "The purchaser’s petition", "text": "Verified petition", "mark": "petition"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.75, 1.27, 1.39, 1.91, 2.03]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The City refunded the purchase money because the sale was rescinded.", "t0": 36.0, "t1": 39.51, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "interview", "kicker": "The purchaser’s account", "text": "The City refunded the couple", "mark": "refunded"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.94, 1.03, 1.47, 1.74, 2.11, 2.23, 2.59, 2.81]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "KQED reported about $90,000 back. The couple stopped fighting by 2019.", "t0": 39.63, "t1": 45.78, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "About $90,000", "label": "Refund reported by KQED"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.75, 1.14, 1.44, 1.84, 2.23, 2.65, 3.52, 3.71, 4.07, 4.46, 4.88, 5.04, 5.46]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The court’s closing order and the City’s refund warrant would establish the precise terms.", "t0": 45.9, "t1": 51.01, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "items": ["Court order", "Refund warrant"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 1.06, 1.42, 1.58, 1.7, 2.12, 2.58, 2.99, 3.17, 3.78, 3.89, 4.46]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 51.13, "t1": 53.74, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The missing notice", "b": "The board decision", "o": "The purchaser’s challenge"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}